msgstr "Putar 30°"

msgid "Fan out cards"
msgstr "Kembangkan kad"

msgid "Open folder icon size"
msgstr "Saiz ikon dalam folder terbuka"

msgid "Rotate on hover"
msgstr "Putar apabila dituding"

msgid "Hover rotation angle"
msgstr "Sudut putaran apabila dituding"

msgid "Hover animation speed"
msgstr "Kelajuan animasi apabila dituding"

msgid "Rotate and fan out cards"
msgstr "Putar dan kembangkan kad"

msgid "Background blur"
msgstr "Kekaburan latar belakang"

msgid "0% keeps the background sharp. Transparency is adjusted separately for each folder."
msgstr "Pada 0% latar belakang kekal jelas. Ketelusan dilaraskan secara berasingan bagi setiap folder."

msgid "Transparency affects the background color; blur is independent."
msgstr "Ketelusan mempengaruhi warna latar belakang; kekaburan adalah bebas."

msgid "Apply to all folders…"
msgstr "Terapkan pada semua folder…"

msgid "Replace other folders’ appearance?"
msgstr "Gantikan rupa folder lain?"

msgid "This will overwrite the custom appearance settings of all other folders. Names and applications will stay the same."
msgstr "Tetapan rupa tersuai bagi semua folder lain akan ditulis ganti. Nama dan aplikasi akan kekal sama."

msgid "Apply to all folders"
msgstr "Terapkan pada semua folder"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

msgid "Existing folders"
msgstr "Folder sedia ada"

msgid "Choose saved groups or folders from GNOME's app grid"
msgstr "Pilih kumpulan tersimpan atau folder daripada grid aplikasi GNOME"

msgid "No folders available"
msgstr "Tiada folder tersedia"

msgid "Pin to panel"
msgstr "Semat pada panel"

msgid "Unpin from panel"
msgstr "Nyahsemat daripada panel"

msgid "Allow customizing each folder separately"
msgstr "Benarkan penyesuaian rupa setiap folder secara berasingan"

msgid "Preview animation"
msgstr "Pratonton animasi"

msgid "Continuous rotation speed"
msgstr "Kelajuan putaran berterusan"

msgid "Rotation speed on hover"
msgstr "Kelajuan putaran semasa tuding"

msgid "0 disables each mode. A nonzero hover speed replaces continuous speed while hovered. Negative speeds reverse rotation."
msgstr "0 menyahaktifkan setiap mod. Kelajuan tuding bukan sifar menggantikan kelajuan putaran berterusan semasa penuding berada di atas ikon. Kelajuan negatif membalikkan arah putaran."
